              "text": "even waking up with a headache, you need to understand that it"
            },
            {
              "start": 10,
              "end": 12.24,
              "text": "all stems from the position that you're sleeping in."
            },
            {
              "start": 13.04,
              "end": 15.67,
              "text": "In this position, you are putting a lot of pressure here along"
            },
            {
              "start": 15.67,
              "end": 18.15,
              "text": "the shoulder joint which means that when you wake up in the"
            },
            {
              "start": 18.15,
              "end": 22.31,
              "text": "morning, these muscles, the rotator cuff muscles, they're going to be really"
            },
            {
              "start": 22.31,
              "end": 23.52,
              "text": "tired and fatigued."
            },
            {
              "start": 23.92,
              "end": 26.58,
              "text": "A lot of times you'll even feel pain here along the top"
            },
            {
              "start": 26.58,
              "end": 29.94,
              "text": "rotator cuff muscle here underneath the top of your shoulder."
            },
            {
              "start": 30.82,
              "end": 33.62,
              "text": "That is a big trigger point because of that compression that you're"
            },
            {
              "start": 33.62,
              "end": 35.22,
              "text": "putting on your shoulder all night."
            },
            {
              "start": 36.1,
              "end": 39.3,
              "text": "And when these muscles are tired and fatigued throughout the day, well,"
            },
            {
              "start": 39.3,
              "end": 39.78,
              "text": "guess what?"
            },
            {
              "start": 40.35,
              "end": 42.51,
              "text": "Now the other muscles of the neck and the muscles of the"
            },
            {
              "start": 42.51,
              "end": 45.23,
              "text": "mid to low back are going to have to compensate for what"
            },
            {
              "start": 45.23,
              "end": 46.43,
              "text": "these aren't doing."
            },
            {
              "start": 46.51,
              "end": 49.07,
              "text": "That will lead to pain here along the base of the skull,"
            },
            {
              "start": 49.07,
              "end": 52.59,
              "text": "sometimes even pain along the low back because they're compensating for what's"
            },
            {
              "start": 52.59,
              "end": 53.07,
              "text": "going on here."
            },
            {
              "start": 53.36,
              "end": 55.36,
              "text": "So what is the fix?"
            },
            {
              "start": 55.36,
              "end": 58.48,
              "text": "If if you're a side sleeper, obviously, you enjoy that position."
            },
            {
              "start": 58.48,
              "end": 59.68,
              "text": "You don't want to get out of it."
            },
            {
              "start": 59.68,
              "end": 61.52,
              "text": "Well, there's another thing to this position."
            },
            {
              "start": 61.52,
              "end": 64.32,
              "text": "In this position, you have a pillow that is likely not supporting"
            },
            {
              "start": 64.32,
              "end": 64.8,
              "text": "your neck."
            },
            {
              "start": 64.8,
              "end": 66.88,
              "text": "You can see that there's a position here that your neck is"
            },
            {
              "start": 66.88,
              "end": 67.68,
              "text": "relatively floating."
            },
            {
              "start": 67.68,
              "end": 68.96,
              "text": "It's not having that proper support."
            },
            {
              "start": 69.33,
              "end": 72.38,
              "text": "And again, that leads to more pain and tension in the muscles"
            },
            {
              "start": 72.38,
              "end": 74.94,
              "text": "along the sides of your neck and across the tops of your"
            },
            {
              "start": 74.94,
              "end": 75.49,
              "text": "shoulders."
            },
            {
              "start": 75.97,
              "end": 78.94,
              "text": "These muscles of the neck that aren't getting that proper sleep and"
            },
            {
              "start": 78.94,
              "end": 80.06,
              "text": "rest and recovery."
            },
            {
              "start": 80.45,
              "end": 83.17,
              "text": "So when those muscles are tight throughout the day, you're not only"
            },
            {
              "start": 83.17,
              "end": 85.62,
              "text": "going to have that fatigue, but when you go to sleep, you're"
            },
            {
              "start": 85.62,
              "end": 87.94,
              "text": "going to make it even worse when you're thinking you're making it"
            },
            {
              "start": 87.94,
