              "text": "better."
            },
            {
              "start": 88.34,
              "end": 90.18,
              "text": "So what do we need to do to fix this?"
            },
            {
              "start": 90.58,
              "end": 93.22,
              "text": "Well, first of all, you need to get rid of these pillows"
            },
            {
              "start": 93.22,
